    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/4dc50beb2d138a90c333574ca740ede5.avif?t=1743431771\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True to its straightforward title, <i>Build &amp; Extract\u00a0</i>combines two core mechanics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>programming-inspired building\u00a0\u00a0</strong> and\u00a0 \u00a0<strong>loot-driven exfiltration</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Programmable Build, Creative Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use programming logic to assemble weapon combinations. Attach modules to weapons that alter skill effects <i>and</i> dictate activation logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be intimidated, <strong>it's easier and more fun than you think</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/25e32fac37e50a190a827d2e3f8a855b.poster.avif?t=1743431771\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/25e32fac37e50a190a827d2e3f8a855b.webm?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/25e32fac37e50a190a827d2e3f8a855b.mp4?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your custom builds into battle, defeat enemies, and claim loot and currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/f7817b9d33557a1f0b4cedd95f1c35e9.poster.avif?t=1743431771\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/f7817b9d33557a1f0b4cedd95f1c35e9.webm?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/f7817b9d33557a1f0b4cedd95f1c35e9.mp4?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exfiltration: Big Win or Total Loss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach extraction zones or defeat bosses to evacuate with <i>all</i> loot.<br><strong>Fail?</strong> Lose every weapon/module brought into the raid\u2014but keep in-raid currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/b59d5d92905e825ca47d1f97507b9726.poster.avif?t=1743431771\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/b59d5d92905e825ca47d1f97507b9726.webm?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/b59d5d92905e825ca47d1f97507b9726.mp4?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insure gear during prep phase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stash priority loot in secure lockers mid-raid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use extracted loot for trading or advanced upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/71fcd84ad74c733bdb8167d2252973f6.avif?t=1743431771\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive Content, Infinite Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo already features <strong>100+ weapons</strong> and <strong>300+ modules</strong>, with more in development:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/51a4d5337437a94195f6f48b6dace534.poster.avif?t=1743431771\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/51a4d5337437a94195f6f48b6dace534.webm?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/51a4d5337437a94195f6f48b6dace534.mp4?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Soon:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded weapon roster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New gear &amp; accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemies, bosses, and room variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-use scroll mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique room mutation systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced trading system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BGM by [\u4e4c\u9e26Producer] from Bilibili</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/4dc50beb2d138a90c333574ca740ede5.avif?t=1743431771\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True to its straightforward title, <i>Build &amp; Extract\u00a0</i>combines two core mechanics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>programming-inspired building\u00a0\u00a0</strong> and\u00a0 \u00a0<strong>loot-driven exfiltration</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Programmable Build, Creative Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use programming logic to assemble weapon combinations. Attach modules to weapons that alter skill effects <i>and</i> dictate activation logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be intimidated, <strong>it's easier and more fun than you think</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/25e32fac37e50a190a827d2e3f8a855b.poster.avif?t=1743431771\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/25e32fac37e50a190a827d2e3f8a855b.webm?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/25e32fac37e50a190a827d2e3f8a855b.mp4?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your custom builds into battle, defeat enemies, and claim loot and currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/f7817b9d33557a1f0b4cedd95f1c35e9.poster.avif?t=1743431771\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.a