</strong>, with more in development:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/51a4d5337437a94195f6f48b6dace534.poster.avif?t=1743431771\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/51a4d5337437a94195f6f48b6dace534.webm?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492070/extras/51a4d5337437a94195f6f48b6dace534.mp4?t=1743431771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Soon:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded weapon roster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New gear &amp; accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemies, bosses, and room variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-use scroll mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique room mutation systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced trading system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BGM by [\u4e4c\u9e26Producer] from Bilibili</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
